<title>USA: TENNIS-SUNDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SUNDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the U.S. Open tennis championships at the National Tennis Centre on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's doubles, final</p>
<p>2-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.) and Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) and Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 1-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Junior boys singles, final</p>
<p>9-Daniel Elsner (Germany) beat 7-Markus Hipfl (Austria) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Junior girls singles, final</p>
<p>8-Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat Marlene Weingartner (Germany) 6-2 6-1  </p>
<p>Women's singles, final</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 2-Monica Seles (U.S.) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Women's doubles Masters, final</p>
<p>Ann Hobbs and Virginia Wade (Britain) beat Jo Durie (Britain) and Valerie Ziegenfuss (U.S.) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Men's 45s doubles Masters, final</p>
<p>Tom Gullikson and Dick Stockton (U.S.) beat Bob Lutz and Stan Smith (U.S.) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Men's singles final</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-1 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
</text>
